[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16442.51, "timestamp": "04:34:02", "text": "おお"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16446.31, "timestamp": "04:34:06", "text": "収益化が承認されました。ああ、ウォウォ。私たちは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16449.029, "timestamp": "04:34:09", "text": "立ち退きはされないだろう、なぜなら彼らは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16451.23, "timestamp": "04:34:11", "text": "私たちにとって。ああ、それは"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16453.59, "timestamp": "04:34:13", "text": "良い。そこには。私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16456.189, "timestamp": "04:34:16", "text": "街に流れ出る。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16458.709, "timestamp": "04:34:18", "text": "わかった。その2つの錠剤は何ですか？ 1つ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16460.789, "timestamp": "04:34:20", "text": "睡眠のために。いいえ、1錠は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16462.551, "timestamp": "04:34:22", "text": "男の子たちのために、彼女が喉の痛みを抱えている場合"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16463.82, "timestamp": "04:34:23", "text": "問題と"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16468.429, "timestamp": "04:34:28", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16471.269, "timestamp": "04:34:31", "text": "もの。プレザントでフォロワーを増やしたい"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16475.109, "timestamp": "04:34:35", "text": "お金。それはやりすぎだ。私は必要としている"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16478.269, "timestamp": "04:34:38", "text": "もっとクラウドを。もっと。おお"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16492.51, "timestamp": "04:34:52", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16495.67, "timestamp": "04:34:55", "text": "赤。私は気にしない。"}]